Z||000001||Monkeyman||10-21-2001||04:58 AM||||I don't know anyone that makes the original urethane ones, but it seems like I remember some place that makes/made fiberglass copies.  Unless you absolutely, positively have to have Mecham scoops, you might consider buying some better quality, cheaper scoops without the strakes.  Sage/007Doug sells some very nice ones (seen 'em in person, got some on order) that are a lot cheaper than any of the Mechem knockoffs I've seen.  Is there a reason why you want Mechams?||||reg||1
Z||000002||rockcrawl||10-21-2001||08:15 AM||||I have the molds. They were pulled directly off a set of original Mecham scoops. Finding time to make the scoops is the problem. If you can't find them anywhere else, drop me an email.....but they won't be cheap.<P>Jon||||reg||7
